# Whitelist approach: ignore everything at the repo root by default,
# then explicitly un-ignore what's meant to be tracked: the treatise
# content (docs/, diagrams/), the YAML libraries (library/), and the
# website (website/ — its SvelteKit app needs to be trackable for
# git push -> Vercel to build from). Everything else (design-refs/,
# misc/, .claude/, etc.) stays local-only.
/*

!docs/
!diagrams/
!library/
!website/
!.gitignore
